WEBVTT

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:21.840
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:28.980
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:35.660
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:41.630
I was searching for your smile

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:49.000
With our memories fading

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:56.080
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:56.410 --> 00:01:02.980
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:10.200
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:34.700
To the Final Battle!
Dartz vs Yugi & Kaiba

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:42.470
What's going on?

00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:46.300
Run!  This building will soon collapse!

00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:47.240
What?

00:01:57.330 --> 00:01:59.020
The elevator!

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:00.960
This is bad!  We can’t escape!

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.400
Master Seto!

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:12.410
Isono!

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:16.410
Everyone!  Hurry!

00:02:26.090 --> 00:02:28.490
Are you okay, Rafael?

00:02:28.490 --> 00:02:29.220
Thanks.

00:02:30.490 --> 00:02:31.720
Yugi!

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:40.990
Yugi!

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:50.910
President!  It’s too dangerous to stay!

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:52.910
Yugi!

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:01.990
Rafael!

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:07.990
Rafael!

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:11.500
Take this!

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.040
Go, Yugi!

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:19.500
Change your destiny with your own hands!

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:21.240
Rafael!

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:23.830
President!

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:31.840
President!  Quickly!

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:38.240
Rafael!

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:40.420
Forget about me!

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:42.830
Rafael!

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:50.030
Yugi!  Hurry!

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:51.690
Jump, Yugi!

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:01.060
Rafael...

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:18.230
That’s what Paradius really looks like.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:22.210
We were looking at an illusion.

00:04:22.210 --> 00:04:24.980
Not just us, but the whole city.

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:27.240
No, the whole world.

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:29.250
Rafael...

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:31.460
Kaiba, here.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:32.730
What’s that?

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:34.970
Rafael gave it to me.

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:44.200
This is…

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:46.890
A map!

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:48.620
That's where Dartz is.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:50.130
Isono!

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:53.160
Go here!

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:01.260
Who are they?

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:02.350
The navy?

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:04.110
Did Dartz send them?

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:07.620
He's telling us to follow him.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:18.240
How far are we going?

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:19.840
What’s that?

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:31.910
Locusts?

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:33.930
A swarm of locusts.

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:47.480
Be careful!

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:48.840
Look ahead!

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:53.800
Back up!

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:54.980
Right!

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:00.040
No good!  We're surrounded!

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:03.270
Becky!

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:07.280
Bring it on!

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:23.860
What?

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:04.870
Do you work for Doma?

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:09.690
Mr. Kaiba, we've been observing Doma's actions.

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:11.670
And yours.

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:13.200
What for?

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:17.390
We know Doma is involved in the global phenomenons.

00:07:17.390 --> 00:07:22.690
But their influence reaches the very heart of our nation.

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:26.400
We're not authorized to attack Doma.

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:31.140
Doma controls the governments of major nations.

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:36.580
It’s embarrassing, but we must entrust the future of the world to you.

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:40.900
I didn't expect much from governments anyway.

00:07:41.530 --> 00:07:45.090
Let us protect you along the way.

00:07:45.090 --> 00:07:46.910
We’ll also refuel your helicopter.

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:03.120
We can't go beyond this point.

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:10.160
But remember that most of us wish you victory.

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:13.160
Thanks, I guess.

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:17.430
My son is a big fan of Duel Monsters.

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:20.950
Please save the children’s future.

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:24.930
Isono!  Launch the helicopter!

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:51.730
The map says he's around here.

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:53.240
No good, President!

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:55.570
We can’t go any further!

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:10.590
The tornadoes are inviting us.

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:11.390
Big brother!

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:14.090
There!

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:19.550
Dartz is there!

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:21.340
Go!

00:09:26.020 --> 00:09:28.570
This is Doma's headquarters.

00:09:28.570 --> 00:09:30.130
Let’s go, Yugi.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:31.010
Yeah.

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:44.380
It feels suffocating.

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:46.890
Yeah.  I feel it too.

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:48.310
Yugi...

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:50.890
Everyone, stay close to us.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:14.530
Yugi!  Look!

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:19.610
Jonouchi!  Mai!

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:22.050
It's their stolen souls!

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:24.050
Partner!

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:25.510
Partner!

00:10:25.510 --> 00:10:30.080
I’ve been waiting for you, Nameless Pharaoh and Seto.

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:39.780
Dartz!

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:42.270
Welcome to my temple.

00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:49.080
My god feels blessed that those with strong souls have arrived.

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:52.590
Your blessing is annoying!

00:10:53.810 --> 00:10:56.590
I can feel your strong souls.

00:10:56.600 --> 00:11:00.330
I’ll prepare a special spot for you.

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:07.170
Whatever!  We've already defeated your Three Musketeers!

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:10.600
Dartz!  You’re the only one left!

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:13.610
Is that true?

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:15.070
What do you mean?

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:17.610
The Three Musketeers have been defeated.

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:23.630
But I knew I'd sacrifice their souls from the start.

00:11:23.630 --> 00:11:25.850
That’s cruel.

00:11:26.230 --> 00:11:28.160
But it's not enough.

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:32.860
I still need your souls to resurrect my god.

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:37.020
Dartz!  Stop with these pointless fights!

00:11:37.020 --> 00:11:39.360
Release the souls you've captured!

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:43.990
Only if you defeat me.

00:11:43.990 --> 00:11:44.870
What?

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:48.370
Behold, Nameless Pharaoh and Seto!

00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:20.780
This is what's causing the feeling of suffocation.

00:12:21.310 --> 00:12:22.770
Hey, look!

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:25.780
The ones who're sealed here...

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:28.180
…aren't just from our era.

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:32.870
Yes.  Souls from 10,000 years are stored here.

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:36.230
And that forms my history.

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:37.200
Dartz...

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:40.670
Yugi, there's no point talking to him.

00:12:40.670 --> 00:12:46.160
Originally, dueling was a battle ritual where you wager your souls.

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:49.680
Let's follow that example.

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:52.660
Then I'll be the one to fight you!

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:53.950
No, Kaiba!

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:57.700
I can’t let you deal with him alone!

00:12:57.700 --> 00:13:02.920
Then I'll offer both your souls to my god, Pharaoh and Seto!

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:10.170
Here we go, Kaiba!

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:12.230
You don't need to tell me!

00:13:14.090 --> 00:13:15.340
Duel!

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:21.340
Valon…

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:23.340
Mai…

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:28.210
I still have something I must do.

00:13:34.470 --> 00:13:35.750
Yugi...

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:37.220
Big brother...

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:39.700
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:45.230
From my hand, I activate the Ritual Spell, White Dragon Ritual!

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:49.730
I tribute Vorse Raider from my hand!

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:53.590
Come out, Paladin of White Dragon!

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:58.090
I activate its effect!

00:13:58.090 --> 00:14:01.840
By tributing Paladin of White Dragon…

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:06.350
Come out, Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:25.280
Since I went first, I can't attack on my first turn.

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:27.730
I end my turn.

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:29.700
Here I go, Dartz!

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:31.260
My turn!

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:36.270
I activate Black Luster Ritual from my hand!

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:41.420
I tribute Valkyrion the Magna Warrior!

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:48.550
The legendary Black Luster Soldier arrives!

00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:55.930
I set a card and end my turn!

00:14:55.930 --> 00:15:02.240
Wow!  Both my brother and Yugi summoned their ace monsters on the first turn!

00:15:02.240 --> 00:15:08.220
I see.  You realize who you're facing.

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:09.440
My turn.

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:13.570
The card born from darkness!

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:15.880
Give me destiny's power!

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:39.170
Here it comes!

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:41.270
The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:55.530
W-What?

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:58.200
His bloodlust is intense.

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:00.910
Even an amateur like me can feel it!

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:01.530
Yugi...

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:03.930
He's...

00:16:03.930 --> 00:16:06.530
…no ordinary man.

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:11.840
Come out, Orichalcos Gigas!

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:17.750
Kaiba, don't let your guard down!

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:20.260
That monster is immortal!

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:24.050
It wouldn’t be fun if it wasn't.

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:28.260
Next, by giving up my life points...

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:33.560
I Special Summon Orichalcos Kyutora!

00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:40.570
I end my turn.

00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:42.300
My turn!

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:56.450
Dartz, if Doma's goal is real, you'd win this duel.

00:16:56.450 --> 00:17:00.250
But you have two weak monsters on your field.

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:04.050
Victory is already mine.

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:06.830
I don’t know how good of a duelist you are.

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:10.330
But you forgot one important thing.

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:16.930
You're facing the strongest duelist on Earth!  Me!

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:19.850
I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:17:20.590 --> 00:17:24.040
I fuse three Blue-Eyes from my hand and field!

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:34.560
Come out, my mightiest servant!

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:37.090
Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon!

00:17:41.730 --> 00:17:44.210
Blue-Eyes Ultimate...

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:50.740
Yugi, if you're a true duelist, you should be able to summon a new servant that can defeat him instantly.

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:55.740
Kaiba, I'll carry on your fighting spirit!

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:57.350
My turn!

00:17:57.350 --> 00:18:01.740
Dartz!  This draw will crush your plans!

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:03.250
I draw!

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:06.250
I activate the spell card, Polymerization!

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:08.750
Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon!

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:10.750
Black Luster Soldier!

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:13.240
Ultimate Fusion Summon!

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:18.030
Come out!

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:21.130
Dragon Master Knight!

00:18:24.030 --> 00:18:27.040
Wow!  5000 attack points!

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:30.040
My brother and Yugi's tag team is the best!

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:32.310
I flip over my trap card!

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:33.610
Meteorain!

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:40.200
This card lets me deal damage equal to the difference in attack and defense points!

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:44.510
It's 3500 points higher than Dartz’s monster's defense points!

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:46.790
This'll lower his life points to 0!

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:49.860
This single strike will end everything!

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:53.320
Go, Dragon Master Knight!

00:19:01.310 --> 00:19:03.120
Take this, Dartz!

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:05.820
Galaxy Crusher!

00:19:32.660 --> 00:19:38.910
Nameless Pharaoh and Seto, you'll never defeat me!

00:19:42.310 --> 00:19:43.410
What?

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:44.670
Big brother!

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:45.780
Yugi!

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:06.920
Outer space?

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:09.100
Dartz!

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:10.910
What’s this illusion?

00:20:11.240 --> 00:20:12.660
Don’t panic.

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:17.540
Your attack interacted with the Orichalcos's power.

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:24.470
An Orichalcos fragment contains memories further back than humans can imagine.

00:20:24.470 --> 00:20:28.430
This is the Orichalcos's world of memories.

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:31.430
The Orichalcos's memories?

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:36.930
A long time ago, everything in this world was created from darkness.

00:20:37.570 --> 00:20:40.950
Including us.  Including our planet.

00:20:41.430 --> 00:20:46.590
This world is heading towards darkness and its demise.

00:20:46.590 --> 00:20:52.450
Unable to measured in a human's lifespan, this is the absolute truth of this world.

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:56.250
This applies to everything.

00:20:56.250 --> 00:21:01.480
Similarly, as time passes, a man's heart will be covered in darkness.

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:04.730
You're saying the heart's darkness is the truth?

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:07.030
Our planet is beautiful.

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:12.470
Its existence is a miracle in this universe.

00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:17.650
Can’t you hear the planet's sorrow?

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:19.800
The planet's sorrow?

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:27.980
What's that?

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:31.280
It’s the city I once ruled.

00:21:31.280 --> 00:21:35.990
And the city I destroyed.  Atlantis.

00:21:36.590 --> 00:21:37.730
What?

00:21:38.260 --> 00:21:41.730
Atlantis was a beautiful city.

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:46.900
But it was on the path to extinction.

00:21:56.400 --> 00:22:05.280
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:05.810 --> 00:22:13.650
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:15.380 --> 00:22:24.810
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:25.420 --> 00:22:34.300
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:34.900 --> 00:22:43.360
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:44.140 --> 00:22:48.870
I'll live feeling them

00:22:49.480 --> 00:22:54.020
For me to be me

00:22:54.020 --> 00:23:02.510
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:08.150
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:08.670 --> 00:23:17.810
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:25.040 --> 00:23:29.680
Yugi and Kaiba's mighty tag team created the ultimate monster.

00:23:29.680 --> 00:23:33.580
Dragon Master Knight's attack defeated Dartz!

00:23:33.580 --> 00:23:37.660
...Is what I thought, but the three vanished into the light.

00:23:37.660 --> 00:23:41.690
Inside the light, they see memories of Atlantis's destruction.

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:43.810
What's its tragic end?

00:23:43.810 --> 00:23:46.330
And who will win the duel?

00:23:46.330 --> 00:23:49.340
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Tragedy of Atlantis

00:23:49.340 --> 00:23:51.040
Duel, standby!
